### Trigger client stage sync
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/client

### Trigger organisation stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/organisation

### Trigger personnel stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/personnel

### Trigger employer stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/employer

### Trigger invoice stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/invoice

### Trigger invoiceEvents stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/invoiceEvent

### List configured ingestion entities
GET http://localhost:3010/ingestion/entities

